  "title": "Tools and Pipelines",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>PanKbase data processing and analyses use a standard set of pipelines, outlined here:</p><ul><li>PanKbase data library:<ul><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/search/?type=Workflow\" target=\"blank\">Pipelines for data processing</a></li></ul></li><li>PanKbase GitHub repositories:<ul><li><a href=\"https://github.com/topics/pankbase-pipeline\" target=\"blank\">Pipelines for data processing and analysis</a></li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/topics/pankbase-platform\" target=\"blank\">Platform code</a></li></ul></li></ul><p>For Data Submitters:</p><ul><li>If you wish to submit data to PanKbase, please follow our <a href=\"https://pankbase.org/metadata-data-standards.html\" target=\"blank\">Data Processing Standards</a></li></ul>",
